  (text "Blocks 1-2: USB-C (power + data), TP4057 charger with charge pause"
    (at 14 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 3caaf428-0b9f-52b2-956c-4dc356d8146f)
  )
  (text "Block 3: cell pads, 3.3 V LDO, VBUS-edge reset" (at 14 160 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 4291e077-54b7-545e-b9a3-4797cf058e7c)
  )
  (text "Block 4: synchronous buck LED driver with cascaded current loop"
    (at 154 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 57963720-bcd4-5ac9-a52a-2c228c05761a)
  )
  (text "Block 5: laser load switch with hardware interlock (gate path)"
    (at 154 160 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid dd626b34-700d-5ad2-bf59-1bd6f57e7e62)
  )
  (text "Block 6: ESP32-C3-MINI-1 (BLE, USB), NTC, VBAT sense, J6"
    (at 294 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 0ac616ff-22b1-51ac-8218-0bd9436ea7ea)
  )
  (text "Block 7: KEY BOARD (own PCB): buttons, ring LEDs, pogo pins"
    (at 294 152 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 484ad9be-5717-5b32-b961-fc46c5a1cf14)
  )
  (text "USB-C: Rd 5.1 k on CC1 and CC2 (5 V sink). D+/D- go to the ESP32-C3 native USB (flashing, console).\nTP4057: R3 2.0 k returns PROG to CHG_SET (GPIO20): low = approx. 500 mA, floating = 10 mA trickle via R29,\nhigh = charger off (only while USB is present). CHRG/STDBY are read by GPIO4/GPIO5 (internal pull-ups)."
    (at 14 142 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 5f385865-dc41-5f2a-b0f1-3a0d6d9578c8)
  )
  (text "J2: one 14500 cell, one 24 AWG wire per pad:\nred = BAT+ (pin 1), black = BAT- (pin 2, BATN).\nU6 DW01A + Q3 in the cell minus: GND = P-;\nover-current 120-180 mV across Q3 (Kelvin) =\n4.3-4.5 A typ. hot, 3.0 A worst; 4.30 / 2.4 V\ncell limits; the charger works through Q3."
    (at 88 212 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 160d3b86-1b56-52dd-bed9-029f44b60304)
  )
  (text "U5 RT9080: 3.3 V, EN tied to VIN, 2 uA Iq.\nQ5/C17/R7: plugging in USB pulls EN low for\napprox. 0.1 s (module restart); button held while\nplugging in = ROM download mode."
    (at 14 270 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid ae44c8b9-5c01-5ca8-b501-dc0fd4e45af0)
  )
  (text "VOUT = 0.8 V (1 + R10/R11) = 2.4 V with Q2 off; Q2 sinks current from FB, VOUT rises until I_LED x RS1 = VSET.\nVSET = duty(GPIO6, 13-bit PWM) x 3.3 V x R16/(R15+R16): 100 % = 71.0 mV = 3.55 A (3.0 A ceiling = 84.5 %).\nU3 is powered from LED_EN.  Kelvin: R14 from the top of RS1; R16, C12 and U3 pin 2 return to RS1's ground pad."
    (at 154 142 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid d34b8d71-022e-5ecf-b35d-2f0afe25a449)
  )
  (text "S2 SAFE (pin 3) ties the Q1 gate to VBAT; ARMED (pin 1) gives Q4 / LASER_ON (GPIO10) control.\nS2 never carries laser current. R18 keeps Q1 off and R20 keeps Q4 off while the MCU is in reset."
    (at 154 277 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 5169d1e6-341b-55d0-b037-ff04abf5cdce)
  )
  (text "GPIO map:\nIO0 VBAT/2 - IO1 NTC - IO2/IO8/IO21 RGB B/G/R (active low, two ring LEDs)\nIO3+IO9 button ladder (IO9 digital any-press + boot strap, IO3 ADC)\nIO4 CHRG - IO5 STDBY - IO6 LED_PWM - IO7 LED_EN - IO10 LASER_ON\nIO18/IO19 USB D-/D+ - IO20 CHG_SET.  Antenna beyond the board edge."
    (at 336 30 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid b5e420e4-00d1-542f-8677-00552dbfa77d)
  )
  (text "J6 = 6 target pads on the bottom face (no part);\nthe key board's pogo pins P1-P6 press on them."
    (at 352 74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 3f3c5c76-9d1c-5027-8165-d39da435227b)
  )
  (text "Key board, screwed to the floor (H1, H2):\nbottom face SW1-SW3, LED3, LED4 (keys side);\ntop face resistors + pogo pins P1-P6 to J6.\nLadder: R9 10k (main PCB), R30 1k, R31 2.2k."
    (at 294 198 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 11076fa4-f55b-5038-bc03-c91509aaeee9)
  )
  (text "LED: Luminus SST-20 Gen 2 on a 10 mm DTP copper board, 24 AWG:\nLED- to J3.1 (top side), LED+ to J3.2 (bottom side)."
    (at 232 50 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 2b56e715-c6b2-5605-bf2c-3c1b803aaee3)
  )

